# Architecture Reference

## Current Focus

The **main image experiment** is `framework/cifar_minimal_dnn.py`: CIFAR-10 or
MNIST (`--data`) → CNN or thin teacher → bias-free mid `W_lin` → decoder, with
optional **wireless RIS**, **AirFC** (`U^H H2 diag(phi) H1 P ≈ W`), and
**SimNet** paths plus kappa / SNR / `N_m` sweeps. Batch sims:
`framework/run_simulations_from_json.py` → `framework/plots_sim/arrays/`; plot
with root `sim_plot.py`. AirFC notes: `framework/airfc.md`.

Wireless / W_lin-necessity validation is also exercised in
`checkboard/wlin_necessity_checkerboard.py` (isolated 2D checkerboard + optional
wireless panel). Treat checkerboard findings (channel rank, SNR ≈ 60 dB, cosine
φ + AGC) as the best recipe for the physical path; see root README §7 and
`.cursor/docs/architecture/wireless-ris-phi.md`.

Older `MyTeacher` / GAN / thin ablation live under `playground/GAN /` (note the
trailing space in the folder name) and are **not** the primary pipeline.

